{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us for a tram ride around Bratislava in iconic and beloved trams. Test your sense and precision in our simulator where you can try connecting sets and switching turnouts. Tram drivers participated in the development.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053640/extras/45aefafefd763a0a622e38878aa5bcda.avif?t=1760005192\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053640/extras_big/45aefafefd763a0a622e38878aa5bcda.avif?t=1760005192 width=1560 height=662 /></span>Players will be able to choose from multiple game modes, such as career or free movement. Smooth driving and adherence to the schedule will be rewarded, and thanks to the XP system, players can unlock new tram sets or new routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053640/extras/fd825e764ca3d090cad658dec528478a.avif?t=1760005192\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053640/extras_big/fd825e764ca3d090cad658dec528478a.avif?t=1760005192 width=1560 height=674 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are currently preparing a demo version that will feature the well-known T6A5 tram, which you can try out at the Kras\u0148any depot before its reconstruction. The game is set in the present day, so \u0160koda trams will also be included in the future. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sounds for the game were obtained in cooperation with the Dopravn\u00fd podnik Bratislava.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4053640?t=1760005192","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4053640?t=1760005192","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053640/6a9fbf58038b2cac7ddc998235cf4f690de61029/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760005192","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053640/6a9fbf58038b2cac7ddc998235cf4f690de61029/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760005192","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us for a tram ride around Bratislava in iconic and beloved trams. Test your sense and precision in our simulator where you can try connecting sets and switching turnouts. Tram drivers participated in the development.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053640/extras/45aefafefd763a0a622e38878aa5bcda.avif?t=1760005192\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053640/extras_big/45aefafefd763a0a622e38878aa5bcda.avif?t=1760005192 width=1560 height=662 /></span>Players will be able to choose from multiple game modes, such as career or free movement. Smooth driving and adherence to the schedule will be rewarded, and thanks to the XP system, players can unlock new tram sets or new routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053640/extras/fd825e764ca3d090cad658dec528478a.avif?t=1760005192\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053640/extras_big/fd825e764ca3d090cad658dec528478a.avif?t=1760005192 width=1560 height=674 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are currently preparing a demo version that will feature the well-known T6A5 tram, which you can try out at the Kras\u0148any depot before its reconstruction. The game is set in the present day, so \u0160koda trams will also be included in the future. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sounds for the game were obtained in cooperation with the Dopravn\u00fd podnik Bratislava.</p>","developers":["\u0160imon Baran","Marek \u017dupa"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053640/bcd43a028d4aba7e635e7a0cc580644cf83d6b58/header.jpg?t=1760005192","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Elektronka: Bratislava","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-6600K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce GTX1050<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 7 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["\u0160imon Baran","Marek \u017dupa"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053640/17f94fbdfd3108f55a2dfcd2908693addfdbd139/ss_17f94fbdfd3108f55a2dfcd2908693addfdbd139.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760005192","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053640/17f94fbdfd3108f55a2dfcd2908693addfdbd139/ss_17f94fbdfd3108f55a2dfcd2908693addfdbd139.600x338.jpg?t=1760005192"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053640/55b17a87aeea98a4ef7631f427fe802eb28f7b2a/ss_55b17a87aeea98a4ef7631f427fe802eb28f7b2a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760005192","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea